=begin pod

=TITLE App::FontSample TODO

=SUBTITLE Planned improvements after the current release

=head1 PURPOSE

This file contains planned work for C<App::FontSample>. The README documents
current capability only.

=head1 LAYOUTS

=item Consider adding a dedicated C<waterfall> layout if a waterfall-only
sample proves useful. The current C<specimen> layout already contains a
clearly labeled size waterfall.

=item Continue improving comparison and collection layouts for larger font
sets and more varied sample text.

=item Consider additional layouts for language samples and font metrics.

=head1 CHARACTER AND GLYPH DISPLAY

=item Add optional character-cell borders.

=item Add optional baseline and cap-height guides.

=item Add left and right edge tick marks for visual font-metric inspection.

=item Add convenient Unicode range notation such as C<0020..007E>.

=item Investigate named Unicode block selection.

=item Improve handling and presentation of characters not present in the
selected font.

=head1 LANGUAGE SAMPLES

=item Expand the built-in language pangram registry beyond English.

=item Keep each registered pangram associated with both a language name and
its two-letter language code so specimen labels remain self-identifying.

=item Document which sample languages are covered by commonly used font
families.

=head1 JSON AND COMMAND-LINE USE

=item Add separate version-controlled JSON examples for each principal
layout.

=item Add more tests that exercise the installed C<font-sample> command.

=item Add tests that explicitly verify multi-page comparison and character
output.

=item Review command-line diagnostics and error messages for missing fonts,
bad paths, unsupported layouts, and malformed configuration files.

=head1 FONT PROVIDERS

=item Keep C<App::FontSample> provider-neutral.

=item Continue testing C<NotoFonts-OT> as an optional integration rather than
making it a required dependency.

=item Consider a separate helper or system tool for discovering and
installing additional Noto fonts and font weights.

=head1 API AND INTERNAL CLEANUP

=item Review whether C<App::FontSample::Provider> is still useful.

=item Review public option names as the layouts mature and keep common
options consistent across layouts.

=item Continue separating font acquisition, page description, and layout
rendering.

=head1 DOCUMENTATION

=item Add visual PDF examples to the published documentation when practical.

=end pod
